content.text:
At 1440 wide, the workshop layout is single column! Expected 3 columns at >=1280? Our CSS `.frame` only sets single column default; we didn't add media queries for >=1280/960 columns! I forgot. Need add:
```
@media (min-width: 1100px) {
 .frame { grid-template-columns: 250px minmax(0,1fr); }
 .inspector-side { grid-column: 1 / -1; display:grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); }
}
@media (min-width: 1400px) {
 .frame { grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0,1fr) 360px; }
 .inspector-side { grid-column: auto; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
```
At 1440, max-width 1440 minus 32 = 1408, 3 columns 240 + gap 16*2 + 360 = 632, content 776. Good. At 1440 screenshot width, 3 cols. Stage strip should span full. Outline left. Document middle. Inspector right.

Also workshop titlebar character is tiny at top right, okay.

The stage strip labels show "Oracle, You are here" but stage tab has mini character that looks odd but fine.

Current screenshot is full page; with 3 columns it'll be shorter.

Also `inspector-side` at wide should be one column; RunInspector then transcript. Good.

At 960-1100, 2 columns (outline + doc) and inspector below spanning. Add.

Need ensure `.side` at <=960 sets 2 cols, but `.outline-panel order2` etc. Fine.

Add media queries. Maybe at 1200 threshold. Let's use 1180 for 2 cols, 1380 for 3 cols. Because at 1280 content 1248, 220+16+? 340=576, doc 672 okay. Could do 3 cols at 1280. Set:
```
@media (min-width: 1100px) { .frame { grid-template-columns: 230px minmax(0,1fr); } .inspector-side { grid-column: 1/-1; display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.4fr) minmax(0,0.6fr); align-items:start; } }
@media (min-width: 1320px) { .frame { grid-template-columns: 240px minmax(0,1fr) 360px; } .inspector-side { grid-column: auto; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); } }
```
At exactly 1440 (workshop width 1408) 3 cols. Good.

Also need the titlebar to align with frame width, currently full width. Fine.

Hero h1 fix.
- Wrap "hackathon-ready" span `className="keep-together"`. CSS `.keep-together{white-space:nowrap}`.
- Update content maybe max width 14ch.

Also mobile header "Open workshop" only, no Connect (hidden). Fine.

Read demo/spirit states.

