Update history with OpenCode onboarding; work units P4-11 integration; test counts; budget; note remote integration. Also visual count 13/23 (assuming add test). Add onboarding test first; then final counts.

Let's add visual test for onboarding and screenshot. In `tests/visual/landing.spec.ts` workshop describe:
```
test("first-run setup is honest", async ({page}) => {
 await page.setViewportSize 1440;
 await page.goto("/workshop");
 await expect(h1).toBeVisible();
 await page.getByRole("button", {name:/Open setup/}).first().click();
 await expect(page.getByRole("heading",{name:"Connect your OpenCode workshop"})).toBeVisible();
 await expect(page.getByText(/provider API keys/i)).toBeVisible();
 await expect(page).toHaveScreenshot("onboarding-wide.png");
});
```
Need the button "Open setup" exists when connection unavailable. In workshop screenshot, error panel has "Open setup". Clicking opens Onboarding. Onboarding heading text "Connect your OpenCode workshop". The provider API keys text appears. Good.
Add snapshot, update.

